1
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:23,463
On my day off,
It has been raining since morning.

2
00:00:37,446 --> 00:00:45,862
The circulator I've been waiting for arrived at noon.

3
00:00:50,748 --> 00:00:58,491
I thought it would be convenient to have one in the changing room where there is no air conditioner.
and

4
00:00:59,861 --> 00:01:06,673
It is rumored to save more electricity than an air conditioner.
Well, what do you think?

5
00:01:10,637 --> 00:01:18,893
It's humid every day.

6
00:01:22,897 --> 00:01:28,201
Candles, stuffed animals, matches...

7
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:38,664
If I put away the warm things.
I'm going to try to see if I can cool off just my mood.

8
00:02:02,208 --> 00:02:09,052
Hydrangea with rain drops makes me think of a beautiful rainy day.

9
00:02:13,065 --> 00:02:18,787
I found a blueberry tree at a flower shop.
Do these berries turn blue? I asked.

10
00:02:19,715 --> 00:02:27,265
Oh no... how about that? 😅
and I made the florist laugh lol.
(Don't ask anything that comes to mind)

11
00:02:32,139 --> 00:02:38,791
It's raining and I'm too lazy to go out.
I got up late in the morning, went to the local florist and the supermarket.

12
00:02:40,939 --> 00:02:50,000
And when I was doing that
I realized it was past noon.

13
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:39,147
The day started slowly,
The day off goes by very quickly.

14
00:04:47,897 --> 00:04:57,147
I accidentally caught a cold and
I took antibiotics for a week.

15
00:04:59,131 --> 00:05:04,949
I've had sinusitis a couple of times, and I've had facial pain.

16
00:05:07,102 --> 00:05:15,711
This time it was a headache.
I was told to take an antibiotic and see what happens.

17
00:05:17,993 --> 00:05:27,949
I got better in a few days, but
I had completely forgotten how hard a cold can be. lol

18
00:05:36,130 --> 00:05:45,734
I bought a beer today to celebrate my recovery.🍺

19
00:05:48,437 --> 00:05:55,506
I also bought some delicious new potatoes to make snacks.

20
00:05:57,810 --> 00:06:05,745
I couldn't pass by the delicious looking corn either, so I add one more dish  to the list.

21
00:06:12,118 --> 00:06:25,732
In the rainy season, the food I want to eat is appearing every time I go to the supermarket,
It's also a happy busy season!

22
00:06:51,618 --> 00:07:02,826
In the recipe, it's red chili.
but I'm going to use green chili peppers that are starting to wrinkle in the fridge.

23
00:07:30,205 --> 00:07:37,338
Bongole pasta added in a hurry.

24
00:07:38,569 --> 00:07:46,248
I completely forgot to use the clams I bought at half price last night.

25
00:07:47,612 --> 00:07:55,965
Heat 2 tablespoons of white wine until it opens.

26
00:08:01,651 --> 00:08:10,388
In the season of many delicious foods, it is easy to inadvertently increase the number of dishes.

27
00:08:24,801 --> 00:08:30,939
Boiled potatoes with 10 grams of butter.

28
00:08:31,935 --> 00:08:41,218
 25g potato starch, salt and pepper.

29
00:08:47,620 --> 00:08:56,101
(I was going to make a lot of these and freeze them, but I failed to fry them and couldn't make stock.)

30
00:09:12,933 --> 00:09:23,916
I should have dusted the cutting board well with potato starch because it tends to stick.

31
00:09:39,765 --> 00:09:48,727
When I fry them, the dough expands and the face disappears.
It is better to make a hole sharply .

32
00:10:00,567 --> 00:10:08,021
And then I dust the corn with 1/2 tablespoon of flour and a pinch of salt.

33
00:10:09,895 --> 00:10:15,937
1 1/2 tablespoons each of flour and potato starch, 2 1/2 tablespoons water

34
00:10:30,747 --> 00:10:37,463
Check the temperature of the oil with chopsticks and fry.

35
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:50,623
This first one somehow failed because it melted.

36
00:10:56,955 --> 00:11:07,072
I re-molded the leftover dough and tried again.

37
00:11:10,664 --> 00:11:20,524
The corn slowly goes into the oil.

38
00:11:24,234 --> 00:11:34,447
Fry it without touching it until it's nice and crunchy.

39
00:11:56,686 --> 00:12:01,830
Add some green seaweed and black pepper.

40
00:12:27,940 --> 00:12:37,383
With beer for a get well celebration,
Lifting the ban on rich food.

41
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:49,892
Cooking on a mushy day makes more delicious beer.

42
00:12:53,125 --> 00:12:59,167
I'm not good at alcohol very much.
but I can drink one glass without worry.

43
00:13:01,428 --> 00:13:10,000
All the recipes were satisfying and tasty, perfect for a get well celebration.🤤

44
00:13:25,609 --> 00:13:32,325
I tend to accumulate laundry on rainy days somehow.

45
00:13:35,408 --> 00:13:44,338
I can't let it accumulate forever, so just do it.

46
00:13:54,876 --> 00:14:03,613
And one more thing that I've been neglecting...

47
00:14:08,584 --> 00:14:19,005
I saved the filter and cut it smaller, and it was dusty around the edges.

48
00:14:22,410 --> 00:14:29,607
This time I cover it well.

49
00:14:44,552 --> 00:14:51,300
I don't know why it's so dusty... 😓

50
00:15:41,721 --> 00:15:48,180
Is there a smell specific to this time of year?

51
00:15:50,761 --> 00:16:00,782
I'm always wondering what would be a good scent for my room.
This time I'm going to try paper incense.

52
00:16:05,666 --> 00:16:11,195
(After this, the fragrance still lingered for two days)

53
00:16:18,271 --> 00:16:23,608
I wanted to buy something and decided to go out quickly.

54
00:16:27,709 --> 00:16:34,553
They say I can put paper incense in  bag, in  business card case, etc.

55
00:16:36,246 --> 00:16:41,294
Try tucking it into a handkerchief.

56
00:16:50,296 --> 00:16:57,108
It's raining, but I wanted to go out in my easy sandals.
I'm going to wear them with waterproof spray.

57
00:17:00,402 --> 00:17:05,546
It smells soft and nice and soothing.

58
00:17:08,705 --> 00:17:17,699
Tokyo station has a lot of underground area.
It's nice to be able to go to various places without getting wet in the rain.

59
00:17:21,235 --> 00:17:28,336
I'm going to explore without going above ground.

60
00:17:44,848 --> 00:17:49,864
I'll take a souvenir for my sister who loves pasta.

61
00:18:00,514 --> 00:18:05,337
Chocolate chip ice cream.
It tastes so good and nostalgic!

62
00:18:08,990 --> 00:18:14,166
And I got what I wanted, too.

63
00:18:17,478 --> 00:18:24,804
I wondered if I should walk outside too.
but I still turned back to the basement and went home.🚃☔

64
00:18:28,354 --> 00:18:36,257
In this season when there are so many foods to eat in the supermarket,
I have to cook as much as I can to make it in time.

65
00:18:40,730 --> 00:18:45,425
These are prickly peppercorns that I bought before I caught a cold.

66
00:18:47,191 --> 00:18:53,201
I had to take care of them as soon as I bought them,

67
00:18:54,806 --> 00:19:00,495
It turned black in some places.

68
00:19:02,872 --> 00:19:15,106
While removing the overly blackened berries,
I'm going to remove the berries from the thick branches.

69
00:19:23,340 --> 00:19:31,756
I thought it would be quick, but it took longer than I thought, and the water boiled first.

70
00:19:41,167 --> 00:19:46,696
I boil it for 4 to 5 minutes until it's soft.

71
00:19:56,987 --> 00:20:02,003
Soak in water for about an hour to remove scum.

72
00:20:09,289 --> 00:20:15,684
Put it between chopsticks.
Halfway through, make a diagonal slit

73
00:20:18,096 --> 00:20:22,663
The other half side, make a straight incision.

74
00:20:29,649 --> 00:20:33,285
Sprinkle salt on it.

75
00:20:36,193 --> 00:20:45,027
1 1/2 teaspoons each of soy sauce, bean-paste, sugar, sesame oil, vinegar
(I used sweet chili sauce instead of soy sauce)

76
00:20:47,520 --> 00:20:55,744
The lemon-patterned thing under the cutting board is a mat for children to use when they eat.

77
00:20:56,977 --> 00:21:03,854
I don't know if I can use it like this, 
but it's very convenient because it can be washed quickly and it doesn't slip.

78
00:21:09,768 --> 00:21:19,372
Thinly sliced meat with lots of lettuce and myoga.

79
00:21:23,103 --> 00:21:30,653
Hokkaido asparagus is only available at this time in June!
(This is a tidbit from a calendar.🤫)

80
00:21:41,746 --> 00:21:52,280
The bitterness of the shishito pepper is a nice accent to the grilled skewers.

81
00:22:11,708 --> 00:22:19,547
I'm going to prepare various kinds of skewers together.

82
00:22:50,361 --> 00:22:58,681
I am regretting that I should have added some bell peppers that I have in the fridge.

83
00:23:06,201 --> 00:23:12,115
Green onions and minced chicken

84
00:23:13,270 --> 00:23:19,505
1 teaspoon sake, soy sauce, ginger
1 medium spoonful of potato starch

85
00:23:29,828 --> 00:23:33,881
Fillet of mackerel

86
00:23:38,512 --> 00:23:46,319
Horse mackerel in season wrapped with shiso leaves and skewered

87
00:23:57,511 --> 00:24:07,532
1 tablespoon sake, soy sauce, mirin, 2 teaspoons sugar

88
00:24:38,746 --> 00:24:47,708
I didn't have any salt to sprinkle.
Grate rock salt with a cheese grater...

89
00:24:59,185 --> 00:25:04,329
ume syrup with soda

90
00:25:07,822 --> 00:25:12,068
Eat a bellows cucumber before baking.

91
00:25:17,744 --> 00:25:22,086
I'm going to eat one peppercorn.

92
00:25:24,602 --> 00:25:29,008
It's fresh and goes well with the marbled white meat.

93
00:25:30,287 --> 00:25:33,987
Ume plum and wasabi on top.

94
00:25:35,777 --> 00:25:41,595
Grill, drink, eat and be busy.

95
00:25:45,968 --> 00:25:51,208
Tsukune with fresh green pepper.

96
00:25:52,742 --> 00:25:57,629
Fish skewers are also really good.🐟

97
00:26:02,321 --> 00:26:06,631
Rummaging through the fridge to find something to eat for night snack.

98
00:26:11,374 --> 00:26:16,999
I open what I bought.

99
00:26:21,814 --> 00:26:29,396
Fruit soda and cookies for a snack.

100
00:26:34,186 --> 00:26:41,448
Just walking outside, it's damp all over body.
I even think that alone is exhausting.😂

101
00:26:44,749 --> 00:26:50,438
I went to buy body powder for the first time.

102
00:26:52,035 --> 00:26:56,987
I was also recommended a body spray that feels cool.

103
00:26:59,018 --> 00:27:07,017
I was so damp that I wanted to take a shower as soon as possible.
I couldn't help but buy it.

104
00:27:08,653 --> 00:27:16,749
It has a refreshing herbal fragrance.
I think it will heal the unpleasant smell of the rainy season.

105
00:27:19,543 --> 00:27:24,976
Body Powder

106
00:27:35,461 --> 00:27:47,695
I bought one with a puff.
I wanted to apply it all over my body, so I could have gotten myself a bigger one.

107
00:27:58,647 --> 00:28:06,550
I'd like to believe it's a good purchase if it makes the dreary rainy season a little easier.😂

108
00:28:23,194 --> 00:28:31,643
Do you have a song that sometimes pops into your head and you want to listen to it again?

109
00:29:00,302 --> 00:29:06,697
I'm breaking up a grilled chicken that I've just skewered.

110
00:29:09,065 --> 00:29:17,385
A common debate about whether to remove the skewer from a grilled chicken.
I've finally come to my own conclusion.
(It's very vain to remove something I've gone to the trouble of skewering.😂)

111
00:29:27,945 --> 00:29:35,239
While making sure to keep the fire going, at the same time

112
00:29:41,382 --> 00:29:47,649
Water, broth, soy sauce, and salt as needed

113
00:30:22,158 --> 00:30:28,297
Pushing the limits of the egg cooker...

114
00:31:04,485 --> 00:31:11,201
A busy morning of cooking and cleaning up

115
00:31:25,627 --> 00:31:31,701
Now I'm ready for even dinner

116
00:31:46,877 --> 00:31:53,882
I bought some pickled daikon radish a while ago.

117
00:32:28,930 --> 00:32:34,331
I'm wearing a white blouse for lighten my mind

118
00:32:35,001 --> 00:32:41,878
A black skirt that I don't have to worry about stains

119
00:32:47,457 --> 00:32:54,301
I'll take the mini-bottle that comes with it

120
00:32:56,184 --> 00:33:04,376
On rainy days, the rain doesn't seep inside.
Longchamp bags are very useful.

121
00:33:05,024 --> 00:33:09,494
I bought my first pair of cold stockings.

122
00:33:11,127 --> 00:33:17,105
It doesn't make me feel cooler, 
but it feels cooler a little.

123
00:33:37,979 --> 00:33:45,914
I like folding umbrellas in a plastic bag.😂

124
00:34:01,507 --> 00:34:09,699
Thank you for watching to the end!

